1
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:17,200
Liberty City is in shock today as the police and emergency services deal with the aftermath

2
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,100
of a devastating attack on a police convoy this morning.

3
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:26,420
As yet, no details have been released about the prisoners being transferred in the convoy and no group has claimed responsibility.

4
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,980
The convoy left police headquarters early this morning for a

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,970
routine transfer of felons to Liberty Penitentiary. The attack took place on the Callahan Bridge,

6
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:37,960
leaving few witnesses and the bridge itself severely damaged.

7
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:42,080
Some of the convicts are thought to have perished in the explosion that followed the initial attack.

8
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:47,120
Revelations as to the professionalism of the attack struck police hours afterward when identification

9
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:52,800
of the missing felons were further hampered by an attack by computer hackers on police headquarters databases.

10
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:59,020
With the Porter Tunnel Project falling behind schedule, this disaster leaves Portland isolated from the rest of the city.

11
00:01:05,870 --> 00:01:10,810
Come on! Senor dickhead!

